{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06187","headline":"渭城曲 · 王维","name":"渭城曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渭城朝雨浥轻尘，客舍青青杨柳春。\n劝君更尽一杯酒，西出阳关无故人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06187.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06187","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据萧涤非《唐诗鉴赏辞典》“渭城曲”条（上海辞书出版社，1983 年版）、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"据萧涤非《唐诗鉴赏辞典》“渭城曲”条（上海辞书出版社，1983 年版）"}